<title>UK: Argentina fixes coupon for 500 bln lire bond.</title>
<headline>Argentina fixes coupon for 500 bln lire bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The first coupon for Argentina's 500 billion lire seven-year FRN has been fixed at 8.475 percent, with an underlying rate of 6.875 percent, lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said.</p>
<p>The deal was launched earlier today.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ARGENTINA</p>
<p> AMT    500 BLN LIRE  BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    27.MAY.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +160 BP   PAY DATE    27.MAY.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY B1	  ISS PRICE  100	 FULL FEES   50 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   BB-	 REOFFER    99.90</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (M) 5-50	SALE LIMITS</p>
<p>US/UK/AR/IT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  ARGENTINA TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> REOFFER    40 BP     SELL CONC  10 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	BANCA NATIONALE DEL LAVORO IS JOINT LEAD MANAGER</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
